OL,3,GNEWSABird habitats to be created from
OL,4,Adredged material
OL,5,
OL,6,FSediment removed from a harbour is
OL,7,Fbeing used to create new habitats for
OL,8,Fnesting seabirds on the Essex
OL,9,Fcoastline.
OL,11,FEngineers are collecting the material
OL,12,Fduring maintenance at Harwich Harbour
OL,13,Fand transporting it southwest to the
OL,14,FBlackwater Estuary, creating shingle
OL,15,Fbanks.
OL,17,FLittle tern, ringed plover and
OL,18,Foystercatcher would all benefit from
OL,19,Fthe #2.5m project, the Royal Society
OL,20,Ffor the Protection of Birds (RSPB)
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
